                <pb facs="0644" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg574"/>

                <head>No. 19.</head>

                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Citizen Minister of War:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>I have received your message of this day, and the decision of the citizen
                    President in relation to the extension of three days, which he has been pleased
                    to grant to them for their defence, has been made known to the criminals,
                    Maximilian, Miramon, and Mejia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ESCOBEDO.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
